{{Debuffnotes
| name = Gust
| desc = The {{M|forced movement}} applied no longer affects the [[debuff immune]] units.<br><br>However, the {{M|True Sight}} component persists.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Gust icon0}}
| desc = Releases a wave that silences and knocks back and reveals invisible enemy units. Knockback distance is relative to how close they are to Drow.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Gust basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}, reaching its full distance in {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Gust cast range}}/{{#var:Gust basic1}}}} seconds.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
*** Does not apply the [[knockback]] component when the affected enemy and Drow are standing in the same coordinates.
*** Has a {{calc|{{#var:Gust value3}}/v1 round2|v1={{#var:Gust value5}}}} - {{calc|{{#var:Gust value4}}/v1 round2|v1={{#var:Gust value5}}}} min to max-knockback speed.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|wave_of_silence}}
*** The debuff is applied on units affected by {{A|Smoke of Deceit|Disguise}}-based abilities regardless.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{cf|Cos}} Has a 0.97-{{M|cast backswing}} with {{Cl|Dread Retribution|Drow Ranger}} equipped.

