{{Stealnotes
| name = Multishot
| desc = Applies {{A|Drow Ranger|Frost Arrows}} of {{H|Drow Ranger}}'s corresponding ability level when acquired.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Multishot
| desc = Requires drafting {{A|Drow Ranger|Frost Arrows}} for its corresponding component to work.
}}


* [[File:Dota2 Drow Ranger Multishot Rays icon.png|168px|Multishot Cone]] with {{hi|Drow Ranger}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] [[File:Dota2 PtoR.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px]] 
** Line [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] is [[Wikipedia:Perpendicular|perpendicular]] with Drow.
** [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 PtoR.png|21px]] is the first {{M|projectile}} launched {{Code|{{#expr:{{#var:Multishot basic3}}*2/({{#var:Multishot basic4}}-1) round2}}°}} clockwise from [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] .
** The following subsequent arrows are launched {{Code|{{#expr:{{#var:Multishot basic3}}*1/({{#var:Multishot basic4}}-1) round2}}°}} counter-clockwise from [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 PtoR.png|21px]] :
*** [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]] {{to}} {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|21px|B]]
** The ability is calculated with {{#var:Multishot basic4}} released [[Wikipedia:Line (geometry)#Ray|rays]], within triangle [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-a.png|21px|A]] ({{Code|[[Wikipedia:Angle|∠]] POA {{=}} {{#var:Multishot basic3}}°}}).
*** However, the ability releases {{#var:Multishot value5}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Multishot value5 tal}}|10tal}}) arrows per wave, slightly tilted clockwise.
*** Hence, the Multishot arrows have the following angles:
**** {{Code|∠ POS {{=}} {{#expr:{{#var:Multishot basic3}}*({{#var:Multishot value5}}-1)/({{#var:Multishot basic4}}-1) round2}}°}}

* The ability has two components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]] {{Symbol|Channeling}}
*** {{#var:Multishot basic2}} seconds after the [[channel]] begins, Multishot releases the first arrow wave.
*** Subsequence arrow waves are released in {{#var:Multishot value4}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Multishot value4 tal}}|25tal}})-second intervals, with a {{M|server tick}} delay between releases.
**** Has a total {{#expr:({{#var:Multishot value5}}-1)*{{G|tick rate}} round3}}-second delay duration for all released arrows per wave.
*** Hence, the total Multishot duration for all waves is {{#var:Multishot value6}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Multishot value6 tal}}|25tal}}) seconds.
**** Making it safe to cancel the remaining {{#expr:{{#var:Multishot value2}}-{{#var:Multishot value6}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Multishot value2}}-{{#var:Multishot value6 tal}}}}|25tal}})-second channeling time without losing a wave.
*** Casting {{A|Drow Ranger|Glacier}} does not interrupt this ability's channeling component.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** Interrupts Drow's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Each arrow can affect the same enemy units once per wave, and stops traveling forward upon impact on the first enemy unit.
*** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**** Grants a non-lingering 100-radius [[flying vision]] until the arrow reaches its max distance, or until upon impact.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
**** The travel distance is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|TravelDistance {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]] × {{#var:Multishot basic1}}}}
****** Neither affected by {{M|cast range}} sources nor {{M|projectile speed}} manipulation sources.
****** Can only be affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
*** The ability effects are applied as follows:
***# {{Symbol|Damage|Physical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
***#* Checks and adapts the [[physical]] [[spell damage]] value per {{M|server tick}} based on Drow's {{M|main attack damage}}, and is defined as:
***#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|([[Main Attack Damage|Σ MainAtk]] + f([[Drow Ranger#Frost Arrows|FrostArrows]]) + f({{ValueColor||Hypothermia BonusAtk|agh|x}})) × f(Damage)}}
***#*** The damage factor is then applied to the following ability components:
***#**** Drow's {{M|main attack damage}}.
***#**** {{A|Drow Ranger|Frost Arrows}}' bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}}, other ability values are not affected.
***# {{Symbol|Frost Arrows}}
***#* Applies all Frost Arrows' ability components correspondingly. 
***#* Works independently of Frost Arrows {{M|cooldown}}, and does not cost {{M|mana}}.
***#* {{M|Autocast}} on ensures all Multishot arrows apply Frost Arrows of the corresponding level.
***#* {{Symbol|Channeling|f}}
***#** Stops applying the Frost Arrows in the following conditions:
***#*** Upon the channel being interrupted.
***#*** When the arrows are still traveling while the channeling duration finishes.
***#* Affects the following units:
***#** {{M|Fogged units}}.
***#** {{M|Invisible}} units.
***#* Does not affect the following units:
***#** {{M|Attack immune}} units.
***#** {{M|Couriers}}

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{Code|WaveInterval {{=}} (Max[[Channeling|Channel]]Time - {{#var:Multishot basic2}}) / ΣWaves}}
** {{Code|WaveDuration {{=}} (Σ ArrowPerWave - 1) × {{#expr:{{G|tick rate}} round3}}}}
** {{Code|ActualMultishotDuration {{=}} {{#var:Multishot basic2}} + (2 × WaveInterval) + WaveDuration}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Multishot icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Drow releases a flurry of arrows in continuous salvos, hitting enemies for extra damage and applying Frost Arrows with a range of Drow's Attack Range + 475. Lasts up to 1.75 seconds.<br><br>Drow can move slowly and use items while casting Multishot.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** All arrows have a {{#var:Multishot basic5}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* The Multishot area has the following additional ability formulas:
** {{cf|expr}}
*** {{Code|Arrow θ {{=}} {{#var:Multishot basic3}}° / ({{#var:Multishot basic4}} - 1)}}
*** {{Code|ActualCone θ {{=}} {{#var:Multishot basic3}}° / ({{#var:Multishot basic4}} - 1) × (ArrowPerWave - 1)}}
*** {{Code|EndRadius {{=}} (2 × Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]] ^ 2) - ( 2 × (Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]] ^ 2) × [[Wikipedia:Sine_and_cosine|cos]]( (Arrow θ × ArrowPerWave) × π / 180) )}}

